===Pokémon Adventures===
[[File:Yancy Adventures.png|thumb|200px|Yancy in Pokémon Adventures]]
[[File:Nancy Adventures.png|thumb|left|200px|As Nancy in Pokémon Adventures]]
Yancy debuted in ''[[PS525|The Transfer Student]]''. She was first seen in tears as her boyfriend {{adv|Blake}} broke up with her stating that their relationship was interfering with Yancy's career as an idol. It was later revealed that Blake only went out with her to find out if she was a member of the previously defeated [[Team Plasma]]. After concluding that she wasn't a member, Blake crossed out Yancy's name and her stage name Nancy off a list of possible suspects.

In ''[[PS548|Epilogue]]'', Yancy played the role of {{p|Foongus}} Girl in a [[Brycen-Man Series|Brycen-Man]] film alongside [[Curtis]], who played {{p|Dewott}} Kid.
